OL,3,GNEWSAClock starts ticking on race to
OL,4,Abuy Scotland's 'forgotten Einstein'
OL,5,Achurch
OL,6,
OL,7,FA fundraising drive has been launched
OL,8,Fto purchase a south of Scotland church
OL,9,Fwith links to the man described as
OL,10,F"Scotland's forgotten Einstein".
OL,12,FVillagers in Parton hope to buy the
OL,13,Fbuilding but face a race against time
OL,14,Fwith less than 60 days before a 1
OL,15,FNovember deadline.
OL,17,FScientist James Clerk Maxwell - whose
OL,18,Fwork paved the way for mobile phones,
OL,19,Fradio and television - is buried in the
OL,20,Fchurch graveyard.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,428,420,260,160,0,100
