OL,5,Achurch
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe community hopes to raise #70,000 to
OL,8,Fbuy the building and ensure it is wind
OL,9,Fand watertight while moving towards
OL,10,Fconverting it into a science and
OL,11,Fcommunity centre.
